  "noteA": {"x": 0, "y": 780, "w": 420, "fill": "blue", "text": "A · Command bar\nAfter 1Password Quick Access and Raycast. Search is focused on open; Entra, Azure and Groups are one list with a type tag. Enter activates with the remembered reason and duration.\nCost: weakest for browsing what you are eligible for."},
  "noteB": {"x": 500, "y": 780, "w": 380, "fill": "green", "text": "B · Now\nAfter Tailscale's mini player and Control Center. Opens on what is active, what waits on you, and your profiles. The full role list is one step away.\nCost: a first-time user sees little until they pin or use something."},
  "noteC": {"x": 960, "y": 780, "w": 420, "fill": "orange", "text": "C · Window\nAfter Tailscale's windowed app and Docker Desktop. A sidebar for tenants and sections, policy shown per role, activation composed inline instead of in a dialog.\nCost: no longer a glance; needs the tray icon to stay a quick status view."},
